# Current checkpoint — 2026-10-12

## User intent and constraints

Implement an agentix-owned Qwen3.8-Flash-Next engine with useful Strata-like
performance features WITHOUT copying/porting/translating Strata code, kernels or
scripts or depending on its library/executable. Strata is research/optional
external benchmark only. Full-expert model; IQ3_S/IQ2_XS are provisional, not
verified supported encodings. DeepSeek is superseded. User wants the complete
